  "solution": {
    "text": "Since $\\frac{F-32}{9}=\\frac{C}{5}$\n$\\Rightarrow \\Delta \\mathrm{C}=\\frac{5}{9} \\Delta \\mathrm{~F}$\n$\\Rightarrow 40=\\frac{5}{9} \\Delta \\mathrm{~F} \\Rightarrow \\Delta \\mathrm{~F}=72^{\\circ} \\mathrm{F}$",
